[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366751230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111220#issuecomment-3366751230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111220","id":3366751230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IrIv-","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T18:16:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T18:30:12Z","body":"I'm also seeing these recommended actions for my app on the Play Console. You can safely ignore these :)\n\nFor the first one: I'm not sure why it's there, as we're already following the recommended guidelines and methods to properly support edge-to-edge. CC: @m4gr3d @Alex2782 any idea what might be the reason?\n\nRegarding the second one, about deprecated APIs: these are due to our use of the AndroidX library, which is necessary to properly support edge-to-edge on all Android versions. And the first two `setNavigationBarColor` and `setStatusBarColor` are used to resolve UI issues on older devices.\n\nSo while these APIs are technically deprecated, we still need to use them to ensure consistent behavior and appearance for godot games/apps across different Android versions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366751230/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368435217","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111220#issuecomment-3368435217","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111220","id":3368435217,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ixj4R","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-04T17:34:19Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T10:34:08Z","body":"I can confirm,\nthe warnings are present in Google Console whether the \"Edge to Edge\" option is Enabled or Disabled.\n\nI tried with it Enabled first, and since I got the error I Disabled it ever since..\n\nThe app works normally on my Android 11 phone, and the home bar is indeed Transparent..\n\nWhat I don't know is the real outcome in Android 15/16 devices,\nhopefully the whole setting is overridden or ignored and the app just works normally..\n\nI imagine that should be the case if Immersive mode is enabled and the app is set/designed to fit the screen and scale..\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368435217/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736816196","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111220#issuecomment-3736816196","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111220","id":3736816196,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eu0pE","user":{"login":"skmyan","id":226445444,"node_id":"U_kgDODX9IhA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226445444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan","html_url":"https://github.com/skmyan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skmyan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T04:10:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T04:28:11Z","body":"If we are using any third party sdk or libraries which haven't enabled edgeToedge will lead to show this warning as well.\nTry updating the versions of those SDKs or Libraries.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736816196/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772571116","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111220#issuecomment-3772571116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111220","id":3772571116,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7g3N3s","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T12:09:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T12:09:06Z","body":"These warnings are reproducible on 4.5.1-stable on Rift Riff (with edge to edge enable in the export preset) and Spooky Express.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772571116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772667749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111220#issuecomment-3772667749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111220","id":3772667749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7g3ldl","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T12:33:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T12:33:45Z","body":"Just for clarity: Starting Godot 4.5, all godot apps call `EdgeToEdge.enable()` by default. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/78c6632eb174aabb2790975cf83e28fee065b43d/platform/android/java/app/src/main/java/com/godot/game/GodotApp.java#L71\n\nThe `Edge to Edge` option in the export preset exists to control only the visual behavior of this change.\n- When enabled, the Godot app does not apply any padding for system bars.\n- When disabled, the app automatically adds padding for system bars, making it appear as if edge-to-edge is turned off, but it is still technically enabled at the Android level.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772667749/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3874558347","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111220#issuecomment-3874558347","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111220","id":3874558347,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7m8RGL","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T00:08:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T00:08:11Z","body":"hey all, we've confirmed with our Google partners that we are using the right APIs and are working with them to investigate the warnings. For now if you app appears correctly in edge-to-edge mode you can disregard this warning.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3874558347/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011977863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111220#issuecomment-4011977863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111220","id":4011977863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vIeyH","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T14:11:31Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T14:11:31Z","body":"Hey all, the warnings on the Play store should be fixed now.\nIf you run into this issue again, please reopen this issue and let us know about it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011977863/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]